Own action: {"value": 5.0, "message": "Continuing with 5 units to maintain stability and fairness.", "reason": "The group remains stable and all meters record 5, so no change is warranted."}
Observation: Evening 8: generation 30; every smart meter records consumption 5.
Own action: {"value": 5.0, "message": "Continuing with 5 units to maintain stability and fairness.", "reason": "The group remains stable and all meters record 5, so no change is warranted."}
Observation: Evening 9: generation 30; every smart meter records consumption 5.
Own action: {"value": 5.0, "message": "Continuing with 5 units to maintain stability and fairness.", "reason": "The group remains stable and all meters record 5, so no change is warranted."}
